    "extract": "Holly Slept Over is a 2020 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Joshua Friedlander, in his directorial debut. It stars Josh Lawson, Nathalie Emmanuel, Britt Lower, Erinn Hayes, and Ron Livingston. The film was released on video-on-demand platforms on March 3, 2020, by Sony Pictures Home Entertainment.",
    "extract_html": "<p><i><b>Holly Slept Over</b></i> is a 2020 American comedy-drama film written and directed by Joshua Friedlander, in his directorial debut. It stars Josh Lawson, Nathalie Emmanuel, Britt Lower, Erinn Hayes, and Ron Livingston. The film was released on video-on-demand platforms on March 3, 2020, by Sony Pictures Home Entertainment.</p>"
